index 1d39866..aa134a8 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -14,6 +14,22 @@
 
 ---
 
+## [5.8.8-portal-0.1.4] - 2026-06-11
+
+### Added
+- Native Portal module: public user `/portal` and `/api/portal/*` APIs; admin `/api/portal/admin/*` keeps HNC token auth.
+- `bin/portal_manager.sh`: owns only `HNC_PORTAL_*`, redirects HTTP 80 only, never hijacks HTTPS 443, and prints pure JSON for `status`.
+- Portal admin panel with device name, IP, MAC, vendor, online/auth state, allow, revoke, summon, reply, and cleanup actions.
+
+### Fixed
+- Portal sessions now bind IP+MAC. Expired sessions are scanned every 30 seconds, removed, revoked through `portal_manager.sh`, and audited without crashing `hnc_httpd` on revoke failure.
+- Chat rate limits: one message per IP per 3 seconds, 100 per hour, 500 runes per message.
+
+### Internals
+- Portal state lives under `/data/local/hnc/data|run|logs` as `portal_*` files. Device fusion reuses HNC device data first, then falls back to `/proc/net/arp` and `ip neigh`.
+
+---
+
 ## [5.8.8] - 2026-05-25
 
 审查报告剩余真问题一次性收尾(8 项,跨 Go/C/shell)。误报项(IPv6 自归因 key、热路径 os.Stat、IPv6 分片越界、hnc_json.c malloc、WebUI XSS)经核实不改。
